---
title: Flip text
tags: tools
summary: >-
    Turns text upside down, so <code class="tool-example">this</code> becomes <code class="tool-example">ʇɥᴉs</code>. Digits and punctuation flip too, and flipping flipped text turns it back.
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/tool-frame.njk" import toolFrame %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% call toolSection() %}
{% call toolFrame(filename, "Flip text", placeholder = "Example: Hello &srarr; Hǝꞁꞁo", actions = [{ id: filename + "Run", label: "Flip" }], switchWithActions = true) %}
<div class="form-check form-switch">
    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="{{ filename }}Direction">
    <label class="form-check-label" for="{{ filename }}Direction">Reverse</label>
</div>
{% endcall %}
{% endcall %}
